8. Add unit tests covering: (a) return trip with promo code → correct `discount.amount.value` and `discount.name`; (b) return trip with no promo → `discount` omitted; (c) promo on return only → outbound omits discount, return includes it; (d) discount exceeding price → clamped, no negative total; (e) both legs with order-level promo → proportional discounts on both; (f) numeric type and currency preservation assertions.

9. Run the full test suite for the Mozio sanitization module and verify all existing outbound discount tests still pass alongside the new return-trip discount tests.
